1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Good morning, the weather is lovely today.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,200
We left early to catch the train to the city.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,800
The driver did not know the way, so we got lost.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,000
The children were singing in the back seat.
Their teacher was singing along with them.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,400
Everyone went quiet when the lights came on.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,900
I think we should have taken the other road.

7
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,000
I'm sorry, I forgot to tell you about the meeting.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,600
Looking back now, everything seems very strange.

9
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,500
Don't leave the door open, the cat will run outside.

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,800
We are going to leave early tomorrow morning.

11
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,000
Who is going to cook dinner this evening?

12
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Goodbye, and take good care of yourself.
